# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only what the platform
# binaries need at build time. The default-deny + explicit-allow shape
# is what keeps kubetest images small and reproducible.

**

# Go source files (but not *_test.go — tests never run inside the
# runtime image).
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Files embedded via //go:embed. Every entry below MUST correspond to
# an actual embed directive in cmd/** or internal/**. Adding a new
# embed pattern → add its file glob here or the build fails inside
# Docker with "pattern X: no matching files found". Regression from
# step-16 CI: internal/store/migrations/*.sql was excluded → operator
# build inside Dockerfile failed with the embed error, workflow red.
#
# Grep for //go:embed to keep this list honest:
#   grep -rn "go:embed" internal/ pkg/ cmd/
!**/*.sql
